  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Runtime boundaries",
      "items": [
        "Web / Host ROS 2 / Isaac Sim are logical execution regions; this diagram does not claim three physical PCs.",
        "ProcessEquipmentBridge and P3020/IW-Hub agents are Python objects in Isaac, not independent ROS nodes."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Control responsibility",
      "items": [
        "ros2_manual_mqtt_adapter publishes manual velocity only.",
        "ros2_mqtt_adapter owns MQTT-driven NavigateToPose, STOP /cmd_vel, and manual lift command/state bridging.",
        "Dashed MQTT broker edges denote brokered channels; the lower ROS/runtime edges show actual command and feedback directions.",
        "amr_p3020_mission drives lift-related mission phases through /amr_a/pickup_command; it is not the /lift_command publisher."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Mission conditions",
      "items": [
        "PickPlace Action is used when simulate_p3020=false; default is simulate_p3020=true.",
        "manual_delivery=true waits for /amr_a/p3020_arrival_confirm; default manual_delivery=false follows Nav2 delivery arrival."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Navigation / pose scope",
      "items": [
        "Nav2 ↔ IW Hub ROS2 Graphs is shown at control/sensor-flow level. Exact topic remaps and TF broadcasters require runtime graph/external iw_hub_navigation configuration to confirm.",
        "pose_sync_manager publishes /initialpose and separately looks up map→base_link for consistency; this diagram does not assert a single TF publisher."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Vision scope",
      "items": [
        "P3020 ROS Bridge objects create/manage RGB publishers; main_mission.py creates /arm_a/preview and /arm_b/preview publishers on the shared AmrMissionBridge rclpy Node.",
        "Detector nodes publish pixel/result back to the P3020 ROS Bridge objects; the bridge objects publish validated results back to detector HUD.",
        "Legacy locate_box service/relay is not shown as an active main_mission runtime edge."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
